      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以啊，我想看看像超級噴火駝那樣\n超級進化後的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5554AFF0C621160F3770B770B50CF8D857D1A5674706B99DD90A36A23000A8D857D1A903253165F8C76845BF653EF5922300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到彩色隱形眼鏡，就會想到眼睛！\n我很在意有著大眼睛的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然後說到大眼睛，就會想到……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52305F69827296B15F62773C93E1FF0C5C31670360F35230773C775BFF01000A62115F885728610F670984575927773C775B76845BF653EF5922300200100001BE00000A71365F8C8AAA52305927773C775BFF0C5C31670360F352302026202600100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "勾魂眼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52FE9B42773CFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我特別想看超級勾魂眼的眼睛\n來讓自己靈光乍現一下！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117279522560F3770B8D857D1A52FE9B42773C7684773C775B000A4F868B9381EA5DF1974851494E4D73FE4E004E0BFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！和我對戰\n讓我看看超級勾魂眼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01548C62115C0D6230000A8B936211770B770B8D857D1A52FE9B42773C5427FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "順便告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，勾魂眼的超級石\n可以在闊星公司換到喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98064FBF544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C52FE9B42773C76848D857D1A77F3000A53EF4EE5572895CA661F516C53F863DB52305594300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
